# Full-resolution source photography (~72 MB of PNGs) and retired placeholder
# art. Kept on disk, out of git: binaries bloat history permanently and cannot
# be pruned without a force-push. Use Git LFS or asset storage if these need
# to be versioned.
assets-source/
.vercel
.env*

# Isolated workspaces for subagent-driven plan execution.
.worktrees/
